sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Officer as 社團幹部
participant Form as ApplicationFormBoundary<br/>&lt;&lt;Boundary&gt;&gt;
participant Controller as ApplicationController<br/>&lt;&lt;Control&gt;&gt;
participant Venue as Venue<br/>&lt;&lt;Entity&gt;&gt;
participant Booking as VenueBooking<br/>&lt;&lt;Entity&gt;&gt;
participant Application as ActivityApplication<br/>&lt;&lt;Entity&gt;&gt;

Officer->>Form: 開啟並填寫活動申請(data)
activate Form
Officer->>Form: 檢查並送出申請
Form->>Controller: create(ApplicationRequest)
activate Controller
Controller->>Controller: validate(request)
Note right of Controller: 必填完整且 endTime &gt; startTime
Controller->>Venue: isValid(venueId)
activate Venue
Venue-->>Controller: Venue
deactivate Venue
Controller->>Booking: overlaps(venueId, date, start, end)
activate Booking
Booking-->>Controller: false（無衝突）
deactivate Booking
Controller->>Application: submit(validatedInput, revision=1)
activate Application
Application-->>Controller: ActivityApplication(status=待審核)
deactivate Application
Controller->>Booking: reserve(application)
activate Booking
Booking-->>Controller: VenueBooking
deactivate Booking
Controller-->>Form: CreateResult(created=true)
deactivate Controller
Form-->>Officer: 顯示成功與「待審核」
deactivate Form
Note over Venue,Application: 後置條件：建立 revision=1 的申請與場地借用，狀態為待審核
